 There are 3 kinds of Barriers :

 (TAU)
 1. Transition  : Format changes to allow different parts of the pipe to use content
 2. Aliasing  : Same memory different resources (may include format changes)
 3. UAV-to-UAV : pipeline stall, fence, flush


 

